07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M01wlNorpTcQ7kNvwHx-uNo&_nc_oc=AdpzWoA1GTpNcfCGsKfhu5nryyAJIkyjBr-Y-FnLb78t2YOw54TygvIpgClWrunEueI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHez68EicxexS5wsYhgsNxyOTsaRYIEp-CVmnlvnL9zqg&oe=6A92B202"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lj05hXFXIegQ7kNvwHRluR7&_nc_oc=Adocj71kRps28Ox5fhkqK68eJGoDpF7TeluZlp_7PXOhoL82u4eLFE8bmcQyOnmSisc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEOvy6eRRzQ-7jByXvw42e8vgoaFHsY-CVm1iCGDPZP6Q&oe=6A92A77F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=faTzQabzQFwQ7kNvwF_aMV6&_nc_oc=AdrcWOfm2AxIQY1icH8bM_roIq4zpqWr96NSKiTeEtehxaVlpo4ewKu_Au5WoP23dJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFg011aO5zo90SFAkbmXAwBtIoqUfxDI59duc2sXZ69Ew&oe=6A92B670"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic